{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"type KnownCustomEvent = \n  | SandboxFileCustomEvent\n  | SandboxFileDiffEvent\n  | FileChangedEvent\n  | SessionIdEvent\n  | CodeModeExecutionStartedEvent\n  | CodeModeConsoleEvent\n  | CodeModeExternalCallEvent\n  | CodeModeExternalResultEvent\n  | CodeModeExternalErrorEvent\n  | CodeModeSnippetCallEvent\n  | CodeModeSnippetResultEvent\n  | CodeModeSnippetErrorEvent\n  | SnippetRegisteredEvent\n  | StructuredOutputStartEvent\n  | StructuredOutputCompleteEvent\n  | ApprovalRequestedEvent\n  | ToolInputAvailableEvent\n  | UIResourceEvent;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L1680","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/types.ts:1680"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Every CUSTOM event TanStack AI itself emits, as a discriminated union on\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"name"},{"type":"text","value":". User-emitted custom events (via "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"emitCustomEvent"},{"type":"text","value":" with a custom name)\nare intentionally absent — they still flow at runtime."}]}],"headings":[]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\ntype KnownCustomEvent = \n  | SandboxFileCustomEvent\n  | SandboxFileDiffEvent\n  | FileChangedEvent\n  | SessionIdEvent\n  | CodeModeExecutionStartedEvent\n  | CodeModeConsoleEvent\n  | CodeModeExternalCallEvent\n  | CodeModeExternalResultEvent\n  | CodeModeExternalErrorEvent\n  | CodeModeSnippetCallEvent\n  | CodeModeSnippetResultEvent\n  | CodeModeSnippetErrorEvent\n  | SnippetRegisteredEvent\n  | StructuredOutputStartEvent\n  | StructuredOutputCompleteEvent\n  | ApprovalRequestedEvent\n  | ToolInputAvailableEvent\n  | UIResourceEvent;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:1680](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L1680)\n\nEvery CUSTOM event TanStack AI itself emits, as a discriminated union on\n`name`. User-emitted custom events (via `emitCustomEvent` with a custom name)\nare intentionally absent — they still flow at runtime.\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: KnownCustomEvent\ntitle: KnownCustomEvent\n---\n\n```ts\ntype KnownCustomEvent = \n  | SandboxFileCustomEvent\n  | SandboxFileDiffEvent\n  | FileChangedEvent\n  | SessionIdEvent\n  | CodeModeExecutionStartedEvent\n  | CodeModeConsoleEvent\n  | CodeModeExternalCallEvent\n  | CodeModeExternalResultEvent\n  | CodeModeExternalErrorEvent\n  | CodeModeSnippetCallEvent\n  | CodeModeSnippetResultEvent\n  | CodeModeSnippetErrorEvent\n  | SnippetRegisteredEvent\n  | StructuredOutputStartEvent\n  | StructuredOutputCompleteEvent\n  | ApprovalRequestedEvent\n  | ToolInputAvailableEvent\n  | UIResourceEvent;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:1680](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L1680)\n\nEvery CUSTOM event TanStack AI itself emits, as a discriminated union on\n`name`. User-emitted custom events (via `emitCustomEvent` with a custom name)\nare intentionally absent — they still flow at runtime.\n"}
